<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device">
  <diagram id="nf-0" name="Explain it to a friend">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1200" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0"/>
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
        <mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:24px&quot;&gt;Explain it to a friend (5 minutes)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Read the boxes top to bottom. Each one is one or two sentences you can say out loud.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1700" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;1. What is PsaOnline?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;An online shop for cute accessories in Phnom Penh. &lt;b&gt;Customers&lt;/b&gt; shop on the website; &lt;b&gt;staff and admins&lt;/b&gt; run the shop from the staff portal. The database has &lt;b&gt;23 tables&lt;/b&gt; in &lt;b&gt;7 modules&lt;/b&gt;." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="820" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n3" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;2. Three words to know&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; (primary key) = the ID of a row, like a student ID. &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; (foreign key) = a column that points to another table’s ID. &lt;b&gt;1 : N&lt;/b&gt; = one row on one side, many on the other (one customer → many orders)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="110" width="840" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n4" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;3. The story of one order (follow it on the PsaOnline ERD page)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;① Dara signs up → a row in &lt;b&gt;users&lt;/b&gt; (her login; a customer IS a user). ② She picks a product from &lt;b&gt;products&lt;/b&gt; (sorted into &lt;b&gt;categories&lt;/b&gt;). ③ At checkout an &lt;b&gt;orders&lt;/b&gt; row is made, pointing at her &lt;b&gt;customer_addresses&lt;/b&gt; row, with one &lt;b&gt;order_items&lt;/b&gt; row per product. ④ She pays by KHQR → a &lt;b&gt;payments&lt;/b&gt; row (with her slip). ⑤ Staff approve and deliver → each step is a row in &lt;b&gt;order_status_history&lt;/b&gt;. ⑥ The stock goes down with a &lt;b&gt;stock_movements&lt;/b&gt; row. ⑦ Once she has spent $100 she is Pro (6% off), at $500 Max (17% off) — worked out from her orders and the amounts in &lt;b&gt;site_settings&lt;/b&gt;. A promo code she typed is the order’s &lt;b&gt;promo_codes&lt;/b&gt; link. ⑧ She reviews it → &lt;b&gt;product_reviews&lt;/b&gt;." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="215" width="1680" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n5" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;4. User module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Who can log in and what they may do. &lt;b&gt;roles&lt;/b&gt; (admin, staff, buyer and roles admins create); &lt;b&gt;role_permissions&lt;/b&gt; lists the permissions ticked for each role." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="330" width="410" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n6" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;5. Customer module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A customer IS a user who shops. They have saved &lt;b&gt;customer_addresses&lt;/b&gt;; their tier (Plus / Pro / Max) is worked out from their orders. &lt;b&gt;promo_codes&lt;/b&gt; are codes they type at checkout." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="465" y="330" width="410" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n7" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;6. Product module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;products&lt;/b&gt; belong to a &lt;b&gt;category&lt;/b&gt; (categories can have sub-categories). Each product has details, pictures, specifications and reviews." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="890" y="330" width="410" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n8" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;7. Stock module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;What we buy: &lt;b&gt;suppliers&lt;/b&gt; → &lt;b&gt;purchase_orders&lt;/b&gt; → items. Every stock change is one &lt;b&gt;stock_movements&lt;/b&gt; row; stock = their sum." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1315" y="330" width="410" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n9" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;8. Order module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;An &lt;b&gt;order&lt;/b&gt; has many &lt;b&gt;order_items&lt;/b&gt; (products ⟷ orders is many-to-many), many &lt;b&gt;payments&lt;/b&gt; (a rejected slip, then a new one) and a status history." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="455" width="410" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n10" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;9. Message module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each order has a chat (&lt;b&gt;order_messages&lt;/b&gt;). The bell has no table: it is built from orders, status changes and messages." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="465" y="455" width="410" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n11" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;10. Shop content module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Things staff change without coding: &lt;b&gt;site_settings&lt;/b&gt; (every text on the header, home page and footer, social accounts, delivery and membership rules), the &lt;b&gt;Sort By&lt;/b&gt; menu and the home showcase (products.showcase_position)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="890" y="455" width="410" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n12" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;11. “Why is there no total column on orders?” (normalization)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Because it can be &lt;b&gt;calculated&lt;/b&gt; from the items. If we stored it too, the two could disagree. That is &lt;b&gt;redundancy&lt;/b&gt;, and removing it is called &lt;b&gt;normalization&lt;/b&gt; (1NF → 2NF → 3NF). Same for the customer’s tier (= from their delivered orders) and stock (= sum of the stock movements)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E1F3E9;strokeColor=#1E7A4C;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="590" width="820" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n13" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;12. “But the item price is stored twice?”&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;No: &lt;b&gt;products.price_usd&lt;/b&gt; is today’s price; &lt;b&gt;order_items.unit_price_usd&lt;/b&gt; is the price agreed in that sale. Prices change, old sales must not, so it is a different fact. Same for the delivery fee and member discount on the order (the blue rows)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#E3EEFA;strokeColor=#2563A8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="590" width="840" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n14" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;13. If someone asks “how many relationship types?”&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;One-to-many&lt;/b&gt; (most lines) · &lt;b&gt;many-to-many&lt;/b&gt;: orders⟷products, purchase_orders⟷products, sort_options⟷products · &lt;b&gt;self&lt;/b&gt;: a category inside a category." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="720" width="1680" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="nf-1" name="PsaOnline ERD">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1200" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0"/>
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
        <mxCell id="n15" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:24px&quot;&gt;PsaOnline ERD (all 23 tables)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Every table with its columns and keys. Left to right = the order the tables are created (1 needs nothing, 2 points at 1, …). Follow a line from the single bar (one) to the crow’s foot (many).&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1700" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n16" value="1 - promo_codes" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="455" width="370" height="318" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n17" value="id : bigint (PK)" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E1F3E9;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="n16"><mxGeometry y="30" width="370" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n18" value="code : varchar (UNIQUE)  e.g. GLOW10" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E1F3E9;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="n16"><mxGeometry y="54" width="370" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n19" value="description : varchar" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E1F3E9;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="n16"><mxGeometry y="78" width="370" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n20" value="discount_type : percent / fixed" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E1F3E9;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="n16"><mxGeometry y="102" width="370" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n21" value="discount_value : decimal(10,2)" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E1F3E9;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="n16"><mxGeometry y="126" width="370" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n22" value="min_order_usd : decimal(10,2) (nullable)" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E1F3E9;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="n16"><mxGeometry y="150" width="370" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n23" value="max_uses : int (nullable)" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E1F3E9;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="n16"><mxGeometry y="174" width="370" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n24" value="max_uses_per_customer : int (nullable)" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E1F3E9;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="n16"><mxGeometry y="198" width="370" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n25" value="starts_at, ends_at : timestamp (nullable)" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E1F3E9;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="n16"><mxGeometry y="222" width="370" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n26" value="is_active : boolean" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E1F3E9;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="n16"><mxGeometry y="246" width="370" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n27" value="show_to_customers : boolean" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#E1F3E9;fontColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="n16"><mxGeometry y="270" width="370" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
