        <mxCell id="n634" value="created_at, updated_at" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="n626"><mxGeometry y="198" width="370" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n635" value="1 : N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;html=1;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startArrow=ERmandOne;endFill=0;startFill=0;endSize=10;startSize=10;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=default;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n615" target="n621"><mxGeometry x="0.7" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint y="-9" as="offset"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="434" y="192"/><mxPoint x="434" y="216"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n636" value="1 : N" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;html=1;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startArrow=ERmandOne;endFill=0;startFill=0;endSize=10;startSize=10;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=default;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n627" target="n620"><mxGeometry x="0.7" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint y="-9" as="offset"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="934" y="192"/><mxPoint x="934" y="192"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n637" value="&lt;b&gt;Relationships&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The home showcase is products.showcase_position (0 = the big front card, empty = not shown) — one column, no table&lt;br&gt;• sort_options 1 : N sort_option_products N : 1 products → &lt;b&gt;many-to-many&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• site_settings: one row per piece of text on the website (site.name, header.announcement_1, home.headline, footer.about_text, social.instagram …) plus the shop rules (shop.delivery_fee_usd, membership.pro_min_spend_usd …). Staff edit them on the Website page.&lt;br&gt;A product is free delivery when it is in an active sort option with free_delivery = true — calculated, not a column on products." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1540" y="150" width="430" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n638" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#D5E8D4&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;1 - green&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; starts here: needs no other table (create these first)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#E1D5E7&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;2, 3 … - purple&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; uses other tables; the number = the order you create them&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#F5F5F5&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;grey&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; a table from another module (only its key columns)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#E3EEFA&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;blue row&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; stored on purpose: a fact of that moment&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;bold&lt;/b&gt; = PK (primary key) · &lt;i&gt;italic&lt;/i&gt; = FK (points to another table)&lt;br&gt;Line ends: &lt;b&gt;|&lt;/b&gt; one · &lt;b&gt;o&lt;/b&gt; optional (zero) · &lt;b&gt;crow’s foot&lt;/b&gt; many" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C7A76;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="430" width="500" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
